# PR 9015 real-app proof, run 2026-10-23T15:09Z. Redacted: passwords and the API key show as <redacted>, URL credentials as <redacted-credentials>; the key is read from a throwaway file and never printed. Store ports: 18250 = lw9015-ch, 15450 = lw9015-pg, 16400 = lw9015-redis (see docker ps below).
$ docker ps --filter name=lw9015 --format "{{.Names}} {{.Image}} {{.Ports}}"
lw9015-ch clickhouse/clickhouse-server:25.10.7.6 9000/tcp, 9009/tcp, 127.0.0.1:18250->8123/tcp
lw9015-redis redis:7 127.0.0.1:16400->6379/tcp
lw9015-pg postgres:16 5432/tcp, 127.0.0.1:15450->15450/tcp

# Clean env for the app (worktree 81ef9a274d12d0ccb0640d7ce4a454a5631b7dd9). Number of .env files in it, then the store variables, passwords masked:
$ find /home/ubuntu/worktrees/langwatch-9015-realapp \( -name .env -o -name .env.local -o -name .env.dev-up \) -not -path '*/node_modules/*' | wc -l; /tmp/lw9015/run.sh env | grep -E '_URL=|_HOST=|LWQL_ACCESS_MODEL_MODE' | sed -E 's#//<redacted-credentials>@/]+@#//<redacted-credentials>@#' | sort
0
