# a. A PostgreSQL-resident view (projects reads the PostgreSQL engine table projects_pg) works without a modifier:
$ /tmp/lw9015/chq.sh "SELECT name, engine FROM system.tables WHERE database = 'langwatch' AND name IN ('projects', 'projects_pg', 'traces') ORDER BY name"
projects	View
projects_pg	PostgreSQL
traces	View

$ /tmp/lw9015/q.sh "SELECT count() FROM projects"
{"columns":[{"name":"count()","type":"UInt64"}],"rows":[{"count()":0}],"statistics":{"elapsedMs":8,"rowsRead":0,"bytesRead":0,"rowsReturned":1},"diagnostics":[{"code":"UNBOUNDED_TIME_RANGE","message":"langwatch.projects was read with no condition on CreatedAt, so the read covers the whole history this project has rather than a window of it. Add a range on CreatedAt to bound the scan.","meta":{"view":"langwatch.projects","timeColumn":"CreatedAt"}}],"followsTimeWindow":false,"followsGranularity":false}
HTTP 200

# b. FINAL on that view is refused by LWQL before it reaches the store:
$ /tmp/lw9015/q.sh "SELECT count() FROM projects FINAL"
{"type":"bad_request","code":"lwql_table_modifier_unsupported","message":"FINAL and SAMPLE cannot be used on this read.","retryable":false,"meta":{"modifiers":["FINAL"]},"trace_id":"8c157d0d7293ba966b30012bfd5307c9","span_id":"bf1cdc98b5da4f9a","trace":{"traceId":"8c157d0d7293ba966b30012bfd5307c9","spanId":"bf1cdc98b5da4f9a"},"fault":"customer"}
HTTP 400

